# docs/decisions.md

One entry per hard-to-reverse decision, logged when it's made. See
`CLAUDE.md`'s standing instruction — this file should be updated
proactively during a session, not reconstructed from memory afterward.

Format per entry:

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD: <short title>
**Context:** why this needed deciding
**Decision:** what was chosen
**Why not the alternative(s):** ...
**Consequence:** what this commits future work to
```

